	"changelog": "Version 8.2.3\n\n- Completes the Awqati Tools menu with direct access to daily reports, date conversion, Qibla and On This Day web pages.\n- Keeps four independent clock tools and improves one-time and repeating personal alarms.\n- Shows three selectable, copyable weather reports from the menu while preserving shortcuts and saved settings.\n\nEarlier release history is available in the add-on help.",
